**Known for**: FUTO

Eron is the modestly wealthy founder of FUTO, an organization that funds
software projects. He doesn't like the Open Source Definition[[source]][0] and
cites other weird little guys like [Bryan
Lunduke]($link.page('weird-guys').unsafeRef('lunduke')) and [Eric S.
Raymond]($link.page('weird-guys').unsafeRef('esr')) to make his case. Eron is
friends with [Curtis Yarvin]($link.page('weird-guys').unsafeRef('yarvin')), a
notable techno-fascist and influence on JD Vance, and invited Curtis onto
FUTO's platform for an interview in 2023.[[source]][1]

Associate of [Louis Rossmann]($link.page('weird-guys').unsafeRef('rossmann')).

[0]: $link.url('https://web.archive.org/web/20251022160356/https://futo.org/about/futo-statement-on-opensource/').attrs('source')
